      "value": "Udon2(WASM)による大幅な最適化は見込めなくなった以上、他の解決策を探してもいいでしょう。\n\n最適化は既に行き詰まりきっており、正直言って、意欲を失っています。\n\nNow that we can no longer expect significant optimization with Udon 2 (WASM), we should also think about looking at other solutions.\n\nOptimization is already at a dead end, and frankly, it's demotivating.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
